  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "巨人模式让玩家直接化身巨型少女，在城市中自由移动并以体型和力量破坏环境",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "New Mode: Giantess Mode Play as a giantess in the game Move freely and cause destruction in the environment Experience the scale, power, and excitement of being gigantic",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4205060/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "不同少女拥有专属技能与天赋，再用武器、召唤物和局内升级堆出猎杀尸潮与Boss的构筑",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Choose from a variety of adorable Lolitas, each with unique skills and talents ·Big!!!!Boss!!!! · A rich and diverse weapon system, various in-game summons and upgrades, and a dazzling array of in-game build progressions to help you smash zombies and defeat bosses!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4205060/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "在可攀爬的立体城市里驾驶飞行摩托、坦克、武装直升机和警车，一边脱离尸潮一边精确狙击",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "With the ability to climb anything in sight, a sprawling map, and a multi-dimensional urban environment, you'll experience survival like never before! · Flying motorcycles! Tanks! Attack helicopters! Police cars! All the vehicles you can imagine and more! Escape the horde and snipe your targets with precision!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4205060/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
